644	    /** The number a claim takes as it is opened: while the sheet's period numbering is in force (its
645	     *  today on or after the setting's date), the next of the claim's period (the one its due-by falls in), <period name>-<n>, or of
646	     *  claims in no period, X-<n>; otherwise the sheet's next sheet-wide number. */
647	    public String nextNumber(String sheetId, Claim claim) {
